==Notes==
*Unlocking all main nodes at max rank on the Madurai school tree requires a grand total of '''15,505,000''' focus, broken down as follows:
**'''9,000,000''' Madurai focus points for the main tree
**'''1,500,000''' points and 2 {{Resource|Brilliant Eidolon Shard|Brilliant Eidolon Shards}} to unbind both Way-bound nodes
**'''5,005,000''' points, 159 {{Resource|Lyroic Bridge}}, 198 {{Resource|Ren Hypercore}}, and 166 {{Resource|Ascaris Prime}} to obtain and fully unlock Thara Tauron Strike
***If a player has already spent the resources to obtain Thara Tauron Strike a player would only need 9 {{Resource|Lyroic Bridge}}, 48 {{Resource|Ren Hypercore}}, and 16 {{Resource|Ascaris Prime}}, along with the same '''5,005,000''' points
*A fully levelled Madurai Operator is capable of:
**'''Way-Bound:''' Increases the Operator's [[Amp]] and [[Void Beam]] energy capacity by '''40%''' and regeneration by '''60%'''
**'''Warframe Passive:''' Increases [[Damage#Physical Damage|physical damage]] by '''30%''', and increases ability [[Casting Speed]] by '''50%''' for '''20''' seconds on Transference.
**'''Operator Passive:''' Increases damage by '''30%''' and Increases [[Amp]] Critical Damage by '''100%''' for '''20''' seconds on Transference.
**'''[[Void Sling]]:'''  On consecutive Void Slings, increases the Operator's Energy Efficiency by '''50%''' and Warframe [[Ability Strength]] by '''40%''' for '''20''' seconds.
**'''First Ability:''' Consumes all Operator energy to increase Operator and Warframe damage by '''10%''' per '''1%''' energy consumed up to a maximum of '''1000%''', and increases [[Ammo#Ammo Efficiency|Amp/Ammo Efficiency]] by '''40%'''. Lasts '''8''' seconds, '''40''' second cooldown.
**'''Second Ability:''' Emits a wave that lasts for '''2''' seconds causing enemies hit to take '''50%''' additional Operator Damage for '''20''' seconds. Killing a debuffed enemy makes all affected enemies take an additional '''50%''' more damage and increases the duration by '''10''' seconds, up to '''2''' stacks.

